1
00:00:06,030 --> 00:00:07,660
你这是在干嘛
What-what are you doing?

2
00:00:07,660 --> 00:00:10,390
红灯了  所以我停下啊
The light is red so I came to a stop.

3
00:00:10,390 --> 00:00:13,590
你开着偷来的警车  后车厢还有死掉的妓女
You're in a stolen cop car with a dead hooker in the trunk.

4
00:00:13,590 --> 00:00:16,230
你不必遵守交通规则吧
You don't have to obey traffic laws.

5
00:00:17,350 --> 00:00:19,130
我知道我不必
I know I don't have to.

6
00:00:19,130 --> 00:00:21,540
但选择遵守才是乐趣所在啊
The fun is choosing to.

7
00:00:23,830 --> 00:00:26,460
你们没有来学院聚会啊
Hey. Missed you guys at the faculty mixer.

8
00:00:26,460 --> 00:00:29,810
真应该来的  甜点简直香蕉你个芭乐赞
Ah, you should have been there; dessert was bananas.

9
00:00:29,950 --> 00:00:31,960
抱歉  这话有点歧义  甜点是派
Sorry, that was misleading. The dessert was pie,

10
00:00:31,960 --> 00:00:34,070
这个派香蕉你个大西瓜赞
but the pie was bananas.

11
00:00:34,570 --> 00:00:36,190
其实这个派是樱桃口味
Actually, the pie was cherry,

12
00:00:36,200 --> 00:00:40,010
但吃起来这美味简直香蕉你个大樱桃
but the taste of the pie was... bananas.

13
00:00:41,910 --> 00:00:45,780
这些聚会根本就是在浪费大学的钱
Those mixers are such a waste of university money.

14
00:00:45,780 --> 00:00:47,060
如果学校少把钱花在
If they spent less money

15
00:00:47,070 --> 00:00:49,660
这些琐碎的狗屁上  多花钱在科学上
on frivolous nonsense and more money on science,

16
00:00:49,660 --> 00:00:50,910
对大家都有好处
we'd all be better off.

17
00:00:50,910 --> 00:00:52,780
你就是个理论物理学家
You're a theoretical physicist.

18
00:00:52,780 --> 00:00:55,580
除了一个办公室跟一张白板  你还需要什么
What more do you need than an office and a whiteboard?

19
00:00:55,580 --> 00:00:58,680
某一天  我的量子退相干导致熵减少的
Someday, my new formulas on entropy decrease

20
00:00:58,680 --> 00:01:01,090
新公式将会需要测试
due to quantum decoherence will need to be tested

21
00:01:01,090 --> 00:01:02,930
到时候就会需要资金
and that will require funding.

22
00:01:02,930 --> 00:01:04,910
你的理论都挺抽象的
Your theories are pretty abstract.

23
00:01:04,910 --> 00:01:05,940
我都不知道该怎么
I wouldn't even know how to

24
00:01:05,940 --> 00:01:08,560
设计出证明它们的实验
design an experiment to prove them.

25
00:01:08,680 --> 00:01:11,570
某实验物理学家如是说
Says the experimental physicist.

26
00:01:12,620 --> 00:01:14,800
我知道大学可以从哪里削减支出了
Well, I know a place the university can make some cuts.

27
00:01:14,800 --> 00:01:16,750
莱纳德  拜拜了您那
Bye, Leonard.

28
00:01:16,920 --> 00:01:17,670
慢着  慢着
One second, one second.

29
00:01:17,670 --> 00:01:18,810
他说的不无道理啊
He's got a point.

30
00:01:18,810 --> 00:01:21,030
要想证实你的弦理论研究
In order to corroborate your string theory research,

31
00:01:21,030 --> 00:01:22,510
你就得制造出一个黑洞
you'd have to create a black hole.

32
00:01:22,510 --> 00:01:24,440
那不会毁掉地球吗
Wouldn't that destroy the Earth?

33
00:01:24,440 --> 00:01:28,810
或许吧  但大家都可以知道我是对的再入土
Perhaps, but we'd all go to the grave knowing I was right.

34
00:01:30,250 --> 00:01:34,060
我想或许你可以制造个微型黑洞啊
I guess you could create a contained microscopic black hole.

35
00:01:34,060 --> 00:01:37,720
有意思
Huh. Interesting.

36
00:01:37,910 --> 00:01:40,290
欢迎回来  莱纳德
Welcome back, Leonard.

37
00:01:40,300 --> 00:01:42,300
抱歉  你得卷铺盖了
Sorry, you're out.

38
00:01:42,870 --> 00:01:44,190
我做什么了
What did I do?

39
00:01:44,190 --> 00:01:45,770
正是如此
Exactly.

40
00:02:05,600 --> 00:02:07,100
生

41
00:02:05,600 --> 00:02:07,100
活

42
00:02:05,600 --> 00:02:07,100
大

43
00:02:05,600 --> 00:02:07,100
爆

44
