好吧  那你去要个2千万如何
Okay. What if you asked for $20 million?

89
00:04:09,540 --> 00:04:11,540
抱歉  我是要做科学研究
I'm sorry, I'm trying to do science,

90
00:04:11,540 --> 00:04:14,380
不是要请嘎嘎小姐来我生日表演
not hire Lady Gaga to come to my birthday.

91
