有时候你想跟别人提一个大要求
Sometimes when you want something big from someone,

95
00:04:29,890 --> 00:04:32,880
你得小心别一下就把别人给吓跑  懂吗
you-you got to be careful not to scare them away, you know?

96
00:04:32,880 --> 00:04:36,160
你得小火开始  慢慢加料慢慢炖
You got to start small and-and build up slowly,

97
00:04:36,160 --> 00:04:40,210
哪怕得炖他个足足八年
even if it takes eight years.

98
00:04:42,000 --> 00:04:45,630
八个漫长的年头
Eight long years.

99
00:04:47,670 --> 00:04:50,050
年数莫名精确啊
That's oddly specific.

100
00:04:51,170 --> 00:04:53,050
你做过这件事吗
Have you ever done that?

101
00:04:53,440 --> 00:04:54,810
没有
Nope.

102
00:05:01,850 --> 00:05:04,890
用这个程度的大功率激光器阵列
So with this level of high-power laser array,

103
