我能理解您为何这么想  但非也
I can see why you'd think that, but no.

116
00:05:36,330 --> 00:05:38,120
你肯定不能去跟董事会的人说
You can't go to the board of trustees

117
00:05:38,130 --> 00:05:40,610
你给了谢尔顿·库珀7千万美元
and say you gave Sheldon Cooper $70 million

118
