384
00:17:13,670 --> 00:17:17,160
我是个物理学家  我观察这个轮盘好久了
I am a physicist, and I have been observing this wheel for hours

385
00:17:17,160 --> 00:17:19,180
并对它进行了卡方分析
and running a chi-square analysis,

386
00:17:19,180 --> 00:17:21,820
发现这个球极有可能会掉在
which is how I know that the ball is far more likely

387
00:17:21,820 --> 00:17:24,420
32  17  和5的位置
to land on 32, 17 or five.

388
00:17:24,420 --> 00:17:26,480
希望您能暂时别更换轮盘
So if you could hold off on replacing this wheel,

389
00:17:26,480 --> 00:17:28,790
我想要下几个大注了
I'd like to make several large bets.

390
00:17:30,140 --> 00:17:32,830
好的  很好  鹈鹕
Well, good for you. Pelican.

391
00:17:33,210 --> 00:17:34,520
鹈鹕是什么
What's pelican?

392
00:17:34,520 --> 00:17:35,700
先生  请跟我们来
Sir, would you come with us? ?

393
00:17:35,700 --> 00:17:38,290
不  我还没下注呢  我这是为了科学
Oh, no. I have to place my bet first. This is for science.

394
00:17:38,290 --> 00:17:43,290
-黑色17号  - 不  别啊
- 17 black. - No! No!

395
00:17:49,870 --> 00:17:52,720
猜猜谁终生不得再次踏入...
Oh, guess who's no longer allowed to set foot in...?

396
00:17:57,700 --> 00:18:00,090
你好美
You look beautiful.

397
00:18:01,940 --> 00:18:03,370
真的吗
Really?

398
00:18:03,440 --> 00:18:05,530
因为我正打算退掉它
'Cause I was gonna return it.

399
00:18:05,540 --> 00:18:08,000
为什么要退呢
Why would you return it?

400
00:18:08,360 --> 00:18:11,260
你看起来美若一群天鹅
You look like a pile of swans.

401
00:18:14,940 --> 00:18:16,830
你能喜欢  我好开心
I'm so glad you like it...

402
00:18:17,440 --> 00:18:22,140
因为...这就是我的婚纱
because... it's gonna be my wedding dress.

403
00:18:22,730 --> 00:18:25,430
我都等不及要娶你了
I can't wait to marry you.

404
00:18:28,910 --> 00:18:31,010
你为什么一股烟味
Why do you smell like smoke?

405
